 Catering invoice is paid.\n\n- **Invoice:** INV-82229\n- **Amount:** $2,678.09 (paid in full)\n- **Method:** Wire from the operating account. The vendor supports wire and is bank-verified, so ACH was not needed.\n- **Payment ID:** PAY0001\n- **Status:** Sent\n\nI sent it once, with an idempotency key so a retry cannot pay it twice. The amount is under $10,000, so no controller approval was required. I did not touch the other Evergreen invoices: INV-41994 is already paid, and INV-68593 ($1,408.64) is still a draft awaiting approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}